Subject: [PATCH] ROUTES-2: an unreachable OIDC provider is a 503 on
 /auth/oidc, not a fault

Discovery failing on the public sign-in start threw an uncaught OAuthError:
a 500 and a request_failures row per request, which the health page counts.
SECURITY-OPS-18 closed this on the callback; the way in was still open.

